time=2024-07-25T11:34:14.365+04:00 level=DEBUG msg="done with this subproject" lines="[{ID:315 Position:8642.508203539415 Length:8.27586206896552 Chords: Text:} {ID:316 Position:8650.78406560838 Length:8.27586206896552 Chords: Text:} {ID:317 Position:8659.577169056647 Length:3.1034482759 Chords: Text:Будь благословен} {ID:318 Position:8662.680617332546 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:На земле, где обильный плод,} {ID:319 Position:8666.818548367046 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Где течет молоко и мед,} {ID:320 Position:8670.956479401546 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Будь благословен!} {ID:321 Position:8676.128893194578 Length:3.1034482758 Chords: Text:Будь благословен} {ID:322 Position:8679.232341470377 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:На иссохшей и пустой земле,} {ID:323 Position:8683.370272504877 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Когда грусть и печаль в душе,} {ID:324 Position:8687.508203539377 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Будь благословен!} {ID:325 Position:8696.301306987709 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:За Твои благословенья} {ID:326 Position:8700.439238022209 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Я воздам хвалу,} {ID:327 Position:8704.577169056609 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Даже если тьма окружит,} {ID:328 Position:8692.163375953209 Length:0 Chords: Text:Все равно скажу} {ID:329 Position:8707.16337595324 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, мой Господь,} {ID:330 Position:8711.30130698774 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Будь благослооовен!} {ID:331 Position:8715.43923802224 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, мой Господь,} {ID:332 Position:8719.57716905664 Length:5.6896551725 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, великий Бог!} {ID:333 Position:8725.266824229071 Length:2.068965517241381 Chords: Text:} {ID:334 Position:8727.853031125613 Length:3.1034482759 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:335 Position:8730.956479401511 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:When the sun's shining down on me} {ID:336 Position:8735.094410436011 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:When the world's all as it should be} {ID:337 Position:8739.232341470512 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:338 Position:8744.404755263544 Length:3.1034482759 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:339 Position:8747.508203539443 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:On the road marked with suffering} {ID:340 Position:8751.646134573943 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Though there's pain in the offering} {ID:341 Position:8755.784065608443 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name name} {ID:342 Position:8764.577169056674 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Every blessing You pour out I'll} {ID:343 Position:8768.715100091174 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Turn back to praise} {ID:344 Position:8772.853031125574 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:When the darkness closes in Lord} {ID:345 Position:8760.439238022174 Length:0 Chords: Text:Still I will say} {ID:346 Position:8775.439238022205 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:347 Position:8779.577169056705 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:348 Position:8783.715100091205 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:349 Position:8787.853031125605 Length:5.6896551725 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your glorious name} {ID:350 Position:8791.990962160136 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:351 Position:8796.128893194636 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:352 Position:8800.266824229137 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:353 Position:8804.404755263537 Length:5.6896551725 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your glorious name} {ID:354 Position:8810.094410435968 Length:2.068965517241395 Chords: Text:} {ID:355 Position:8811.646134573908 Length:3.6206896552 Chords: Text:You give and take away} {ID:356 Position:8815.26682422911 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:You give and take away} {ID:357 Position:8819.40475526361 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:My heart will chose to say} {ID:358 Position:8824.059927677408 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:359 Position:8828.19785871184 Length:3.6206896552 Chords: Text:You give and take away} {ID:360 Position:8831.81854836704 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:You give and take away} {ID:361 Position:8835.95647940154 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:My heart will chose to say} {ID:362 Position:8840.61165181534 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:363 Position:8845.266824229071 Length:2.0689655172413666 Chords: Text:} {ID:364 Position:8845.784065608412 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:365 Position:8849.921996642912 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your name} {ID:366 Position:8854.059927677412 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Blessed be the name of the Lord} {ID:367 Position:8858.197858711812 Length:5.6896551725 Chords: Text:Blessed be Your glorious name} {ID:368 Position:8862.335789746343 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, мой Господь,} {ID:369 Position:8866.473720780843 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Будь благослооовен!} {ID:370 Position:8870.611651815343 Length:4.1379310344 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, мой Господь,} {ID:371 Position:8874.749582849743 Length:5.6896551725 Chords: Text:Будь благословен, великий Бог!} {ID:372 Position:8880.439238022174 Length:2.0689655172413666 Chords: Text:} {ID:373 Position:8881.990962160115 Length:3.6206896552 Chords: Text:Ты можешь всё мне дать,} {ID:374 Position:8885.611651815316 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Ты можешь всё отнять,} {ID:375 Position:8889.749582849816 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Но я хочу за всё} {ID:376 Position:8894.404755263615 Length:4.6551724138 Chords: Text:Тебя благословлять!} {ID:377 Position:8898.542686298046 Length:3.6206896552 Chords: Text:Ты можешь всё мне дать,} {ID:378 Position:8902.163375953247 Length:4.1379310345 Chords: Text:Ты можешь всё отнять,} {ID:379 Positi